=============================

Traefik Dashboard is available at: http://dashboard.localhost/dashboard/

To create an Ingress, use the default IngressClass 'public' or 'traefik':

  apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1
  kind: Ingress
  metadata:
    name: my-ingress
  spec:
    rules:
    - host: my-app.example.com
      http:
        paths:
        - path: /
          pathType: Prefix
          backend:
            service:
              name: my-service
              port:
                number: 80

Gateway API is also available. Create HTTPRoute resources for modern routing.
